# Tap A Ride: the whole project, explained

> **Know your fare. Know your ride. Just tap.**
> Tap A Ride is the Abuja Smart Mobility Platform: one system where riders book and pay for transport with a tap card or QR code, and operators, fleet owners and the FCTA see every trip, every naira and every verified vehicle.

This file explains everything about the project in one place: the problem, the product, how the code is built and why, how money is made, and where we are going. It is written in Markdown, so it reads well in any editor or on GitHub.

Last updated: 5 November 2026.

