## 23. Glossary

| Term | Meaning |
|---|---|
| **ATDEW** | Abuja Tech and Digital Economy Week, hosted by Young Innovators of Nigeria |
| **NIC** | National Innovation Challenge, the ATDEW pitch competition |
| **FCT / FCTA** | Federal Capital Territory / its Administration |
| **DRTS** | Directorate of Road Traffic Services |
| **"One chance"** | Robbery by criminals posing as commercial drivers and passengers |
| **Multi-tenant** | One platform serving many companies, each seeing only its own data |
| **Row-level security (RLS)** | Database rules that decide which rows each user can read |
| **Security definer function** | A database function that runs with elevated rights but checks the caller's role itself |
| **Under-remittance** | A driver handing the owner less than the vehicle actually earned |
| **MMO** | Mobile Money Operator, the CBN licence required to hold customer funds |
| **Split payment** | One payment automatically divided between operator and platform |
| **Validator** | The device on a bus that reads a tap card or QR code |
| **DESFire** | A secure contactless card type that is hard to clone |
| **Anon key** | Supabase's public key for browsers; safe to publish because RLS protects the data |
| **Tapi** | Tap A Ride's 3D mascot and AI ride assistant |
| **FindMe AI** | Our sister project: safety map, traffic, incidents, SOS and road routes |
